Still 1.2.0. Phone taps were not being missed, they were not being heard at all.

A flag saying "the rider is talking" is written by the capture worker, and the worker does not run while listening — so if you were talking when capture stopped, it stayed stuck on and the detector never listened again.

Speaking on the helmet is a separate thing: a consonant is an impact, and what tells it from a tap is the vowel behind it. Measured, and now rejected on that.
